  "setting": "柏樹坡地上的岩窟石階",
  "subtitle": "",
  "subtitle_en": "",
  "lead": "她在兩個地方各留了一張椅子。地上有等候生長的田，地下有盛著穀物的碗，也有人與她共坐。收成之後，她把披肩留在椅背，再走向亮著燈的房間。",
  "lead_en": "She leaves a chair in each of two homes. Above are fields waiting to grow. Below are bowls of grain, and someone to sit beside. After the harvest, she leaves her shawl on a chair and walks toward a lighted room.",
  "statement_title": "",
  "statement": "她在兩個地方各留了一張椅子。地上有等候生長的田，地下有盛著穀物的碗，也有人與她共坐。收成之後，她把披肩留在椅背，再走向亮著燈的房間。\n\n回來不是結束，\n離開也不必帶走一切。\n椅背上留著一件衣服，\n下一次，仍有地方坐下。",
  "statement_en": "She leaves a chair in each of two homes. Above are fields waiting to grow. Below are bowls of grain, and someone to sit beside. After the harvest, she leaves her shawl on a chair and walks toward a lighted room.\n\nReturning is not an ending.\nLeaving need not take everything away.\nA shawl remains on a chair.\nNext time, there will still be a place to sit.",
  "afterword": "回來不是結束，\n離開也不必帶走一切。\n椅背上留著一件衣服，\n下一次，仍有地方坐下。",
  "afterword_en": "Returning is not an ending.\nLeaving need not take everything away.\nA shawl remains on a chair.\nNext time, there will still be a place to sit.",
  "series_statement": "《神話未完成》\n史旺姬走進流傳至今的神話，留下它最核心的問題，讓它面對今天的生活。神話一直被講述、被使用，所以還沒有完成。",
  "series_statement_en": "Myths in the Making\nSwanky Ji steps into myths that are still being told, keeps the question at their heart, and lets it meet the life we live now. A myth that is still told and still used is not yet finished.",
